// =============================================================================
// who-he-is-course — "Who He Is: the Whole Word, from Before Time to For Ever"
// =============================================================================
// Darrell, 2026-09-29, reacting to L196: "We needed a lesson wide curriculum
// with all!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! No matter if He was there or not!!!!!! Clarity
// clarification of where when what how timeless timelines and Who He Is!!!!!!"
//
// A self-paced course on the same Learn engine as the History course and
// Made in Time. It walks the line from before time to for ever, one era per
// lesson (small eras joined, the church age split into Acts, the letters and
// Revelation), and every lesson carries its REGISTER: every passage of its
// era from who-he-is-data.json, each shown with where, when, what, how,
// whether He was there, and Who He Is (rendered by WhoHeIsRegister.jsx from
// `module.whoHeIs`). Across the course every passage sits in exactly one
// lesson; the last two lessons gather the passages by what they POINT to
// (He comes again; for ever), so the line has both of its ends.
//
// THE DISCIPLINES (binding):
//  - THE RULE, NOT TASTE (DR-0675): what is in comes from the written rule in
//    who-he-is-rules.js, run by scripts/who-he-is-generate.mjs. Lesson 1
//    teaches the rule and shows the edge (the passages it does not reach).
//  - EVERY COUNT IS DERIVED (DR-0076): the numbers in these sentences are
//    computed from the data when the module loads (numberWords over
//    registerFor / whoHeIsTotals). None is typed. The course test pins it.
//  - WORD-FIRST, TEACH NOT DEBATE (DR-0098): each lesson opens with the Word
//    and works it in numbered movements; the Word explains the Word.
//  - VERBATIM KJV: every quoted span is fetched from app/public/bible/kjv and
//    checked against the verse it names by who-he-is-course.test.js.
//  - OUR VOICE (CLAUDE.md, DR-0210): Yahweh, never the generic name, outside a
//    quotation; He, His, Him for the Godhead; the adversary never capitalized.
//  - FOUR BANDS, MEASURED (child, youth, teen, senior): the house's band gates
//    (full-levels, reading-level, band-differentiation, title-in-narrative)
//    run over every lesson in the course test.
// =============================================================================

